  "problem": "Suppose the following random sample was drawn from the uniform distribution $U[0,1].$ \n\n$$\n0.198,\\,0.266,\\,0.322\n$$\n\nUse these numbers to generate three random numbers that follow a probability distribution with the PDF $f(x),$ given by\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}},\\, & 1\\le x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRound your answers to $3$ decimal places.",
